        <mxCell id="Kjh7P_DFYhS-cOcHiteA-58" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;A programming &quot;ticket&quot; is a collection of one or more programming tasks, each of which can have their own part number, task type (type of program), and due date. There can be multiple tasks for the same part number as long as they have different task types.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Tasks have an initial estimated due date assigned by the Quality Engineer. The due dates may change as the dates in production schedules change.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1170" y="100" width="470" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
